\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836310/extras/2ba4e1fed3037feb9e688b6f52bf3201.mp4?t=1710206727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Seize territory and expand. Territorial conquest is not just an option but a necessity for those seeking supreme glory.<br><br>In &quot;Refrega&quot;, every match is an opportunity to showcase your tactical mastery. Be ready to make quick decisions, adapt your strategy, and emerge victorious in a world where the battle for supremacy never ceases. The playing field is set. The question is: Do you have what it takes to dominate?",
